generators(WittIdeal) -- Extract the generators of a WittIdeal.
***************************************************************

  * Function: *note generators: (Macaulay2Doc)generators,
  * Usage: 
        L = generators(WI)
  * Inputs:
      * WI, an instance of the type *note WittIdeal: WittIdeal,, 
