===========

Returns the generators of the WittIdeal. Please note these are returned as a
list, as opposed to a matrix.

+----------------------------+
|i1 : R = GF(3)[x,y];        |
+----------------------------+
|i2 : WR = witt(2, R);       |
+----------------------------+
|i3 : w1 = witt{x,y};        |
+----------------------------+
|i4 : w2 = witt{x^2,y^2};    |
+----------------------------+
|i5 : WI = wittIdeal(w1, w2);|
+----------------------------+
|i6 : generators(WI)         |
|                            |
|                2   2       |
|o6 = {{x, y}, {x , y }}     |
|                            |
|o6 : List                   |
+----------------------------+

