WittIdeal -- Ideals in Witt rings.
**********************************

Description
===========

A class for ideals in WittPolynomialRing and WittQuotientRing. It can be built
using the wittIdeal method.



+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = (ZZ/5)[x,y];                  |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : WR = witt(2, R);                  |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : w1 = witt{x,y};                   |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : w2 = witt{x^2, y^2};              |
+---------------------------------------+
|i5 : w3 = witt{x^3, y^3};              |
+---------------------------------------+
|i6 : WI = wittIdeal(w1, w2, w3)        |
|                                       |
|                      2   2     3   3  |
|o6 = ideal ({x, y}, {x , y }, {x , y })|
|                                       |
|o6 : WittIdeal                         |
+---------------------------------------+

