        elements of a Witt ring
  * Outputs:
      * w, an instance of the type *note WittRingElement: WittRingElement,, the
        sum of w1 and w2

Description
===========

Given Witt vectors w1 and w2, this computes their sum (corresponding to the
addition operation inherited via the ghost maps)

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/5[x,y,z,w]                            |
|                                                  |
|o1 = R                                            |
|                                                  |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : w1 = witt{x,y}                               |
|                                                  |
|o2 = {x, y}                                       |
|                                                  |
|o2 : WittRingElement                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : w2 = witt{z,w}                               |
|                                                  |
|o3 = {z, w}                                       |
|                                                  |
|o3 : WittRingElement                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : w1+w2                                        |
|                                                  |
|                4      3 2     2 3      4         |
|o4 = {x + z, - x z - 2x z  - 2x z  - x*z  + y + w}|
|                                                  |
|o4 : WittRingElement                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

