    on Witt rings by a RingMap.
  * *note wittFrobenius(WittPolynomialRing):
    wittFrobenius_lpWittPolynomialRing_rp, -- The (Witt) Frobenius map of a
    Witt ring
  * "wittFrobenius(WittQuotientRing)" -- see *note
