wittRingToTuple -- Converts an element of the explicit presentation of a Witt ring into a tuple.
************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        w = wittRingToTuple r
  * Inputs:
      * r, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, an element of a
        ring that is of the form explicit(W) for W a Witt ring
  * Outputs:
      * w, an instance of the type *note WittRingElement: WittRingElement,, 

Description
===========

Given an element r of a ring WR, which must be obtained as R = explicit(W) for
a WittPolynomialRing or WittQuotientRing, this returns the corresponding tuple
of W under the isomorphism between W and WR

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/5[x]                                  |
|                                                  |
|o1 = R                                            |
|                                                  |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                               |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : W = witt(2,R)                                |
|                                                  |
|o2 = Witt (R)                                     |
|         2                                        |
|                                                  |
|o2 : WittPolynomialRing                           |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : WR = explicit W                              |
|                                                  |
|o3 = WR                                           |
|                                                  |
|o3 : QuotientRing                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : w = WR_0+WR_1+WR_2+WR_3                      |
|                                                  |
|o4 = T         + T         + T         + T        |
|      {0, {1}}    {1, {1}}    {1, {2}}    {1, {3}}|
|                                                  |
|o4 : WR                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : wittRingToTuple(w)                           |
|                                                  |
|          3    2                                  |
|o5 = {x, x  + x  + x}                             |
|                                                  |
|o5 : WittRingElement                              |
+--------------------------------------------------+

